{"id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-ch-independence.md","title":"CH Independence","display":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-ch-independence","aliases":["92-thm-ch-independence"],"display":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence","depends_on":["[[92-df-zfc]]","[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]","[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"],"source":"原书之外；Gödel–Cohen 相对相容性结果；Han–van Doorn 2102.02901","source_status":"外部背景定理；完整证明为外部引用"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-ch-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-ch-independence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc49b3195ceaea0d\" href=\"?note=bc49b3195ceaea0d\" title=\"92-df-continuum-hypothesis\">92-df-continuum-hypothesis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外；Gödel–Cohen 相对相容性结果；Han–van Doorn 2102.02901"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定理；完整证明为外部引用"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span> 分别见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a>和<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc49b3195ceaea0d\" href=\"?note=bc49b3195ceaea0d\" title=\"92-df-continuum-hypothesis\">92-df-continuum-hypothesis</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\equiv\\neg(T\\vdash_\\in\\bot_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\equiv\\neg(T\\vdash_\\in\\bot_\\in)\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ch\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\mathrm{CH}_\\in)\n\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ch\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\mathrm{CH}_\\in)\n\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是通常集合论的相对相容性结果。构造 L 给正侧，Cohen 的 forcing 给负侧；不是由 Gödel 第一不完备性本身得出 CH 独立。\n最后两项由前两项和闭句演绎定理得到：若基础理论证明 CH，其添加 ¬CH 的相容扩张就会矛盾；反侧同理。不以存在可数传递模型替代这里较弱的外部相容性假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>给定 Smullyan PDF 不包含这个集合论证明。外部一次来源为 <a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC221287/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cohen (1963), The Independence of the Continuum Hypothesis</a>；可核对现代完整形式化说明 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.02901\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Han–van Doorn, A Formal Proof of the Independence of the Continuum Hypothesis</a>。本节点固定了陈述的语言和有限演算，引用该结果，没有在此重建构造 L、布尔值模型或 forcing 的全部证明，也没有运行论文的 Lean 工程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-continuum-hypothesis","status":"resolved","id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$、$\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$ 分别见[[92-df-zfc]]和[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-continuum-hypothesis","status":"resolved","id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$、$\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in$ 分别见[[92-df-zfc]]和[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi$ 及 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\equiv\\neg(T\\vdash_\\in\\bot_\\in)$ 见[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\equiv\\neg(T\\vdash_\\in\\bot_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ch\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\Longrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\mathrm{CH}_\\in)\n\\land\\neg(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\neg\\mathrm{CH}_\\in).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2169,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"名字由秩递归得到；名字中的子名字具有更低集合秩，故 valuation 唯一存在。$\\operatorname{Name}^{\\mathbb P}_M\\subseteq M$，其 valuation 像为集合。空名字属于 $N_1$，取值为空集，故 $M[G]$ 非空，能使用一般成员语言语义。\n外部可数性使 M 中稠密集可以枚举。给定任意 p，从 p 开始依次选更强条件落入各稠密集，取该链的向上闭包得到含 p 的 M-generic 滤子；因此语义定义并非因没有泛型滤子而真空成立。\n上式是外部语义 forcing；没有把它宣称为已经完成的 M 内可定义关系。秩递归的句法 forcing 与它的等价及 $M[G]\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$ 仍依赖 Forcing Theorem 的外部证明。CTM 假设严格强于单说 ZFC 相容，不据此无条件推出相对相容性。\n这是原书之外的背景；CH 独立性的相对相容性记录见[[92-thm-ch-independence]]，该导航链接不是本定义的数学依赖。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ch-independence]]"}],"outgoing":["66c9470f107a6bad","bc49b3195ceaea0d","f1751959740e455f"]}